sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor M as Member
  participant UI as React UI
  participant API as Express API
  participant SQL as MySQL
  participant DOC as MongoDB
  M->>UI: Place order
  UI->>API: POST /api/cart/checkout
  API->>DOC: read consumable_carts (userId)
  rect rgb(227, 239, 237)
  note over API,SQL: Phase 1 — SQL transaction
  API->>SQL: BEGIN
  API->>SQL: SELECT … FROM consumables … FOR UPDATE
  alt stock insufficient / any error
    API->>SQL: ROLLBACK
    API-->>UI: 409 + trace (nothing saved, cart kept)
  else stock OK
    API->>SQL: UPDATE consumables SET stock_quantity = stock_quantity - q
    API->>SQL: INSERT requests · INSERT request_items
    API->>SQL: COMMIT
  end
  end
  rect rgb(251, 243, 228)
  note over API,DOC: Phase 2 — MongoDB transaction
  API->>DOC: startTransaction()
  API->>DOC: clear cart · insert activity_logs · insert notifications
  alt any Mongo error
    API->>DOC: abortTransaction()
    API->>SQL: compensating txn: restore stock, DELETE request
    API-->>UI: 500 + trace (both DBs back to original state)
  else ok
    API->>DOC: commitTransaction()
    API-->>UI: 201 { requestId, trace, stockBefore, stockAfter }
  end
  end
